# Python — the Tools/ scripts are committed, their build artifacts are not
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Word / Excel lock and recovery files. CLAUDE.md already tells readers to ignore these;
# this stops them being committed in the first place.
~$*
~WRL*.tmp

# Generated client deliverables are DELIBERATELY NOT LISTED HERE.
# MVP-1/SRS/*.docx and *.xlsx are output, but they are the artifacts the client is sent
# and signed off against, so they are committed on purpose. The rule is "edit the markdown
# source and re-render", not "do not track the render".

# Link-check working files. The baseline IS committed - it is the migration test fixture.
tools/_linkcheck_unresolved.txt
tools/*.tmp
